                        "sense_id": "c458bb46-9ce3-335d-89a1-26a52b1f5579",
                        "entry_id": "adffadb0-92be-36c9-90fd-9c8bf047cbbf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "unreservedly; fully"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5051f220-0b69-486e-a2f5-3898409290c9",
                                "sense_id": "c458bb46-9ce3-335d-89a1-26a52b1f5579",
                                "text": "Quite plumply, forgot the appointment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29994f6f-be2e-4c59-8ee3-30df4219b993",
                                "sense_id": "c458bb46-9ce3-335d-89a1-26a52b1f5579",
                                "text": "He was plumply pleased by salutes on the street from unknown small boys; his ears were tickled to ruddy ecstasy by hearing himself called \"Colonel;\" and if he did not attend Sunday School merely to be thus exalted, certainly he thought about it all the way there."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f32f756-22cc-49d6-89fc-a6a4b3a6b6f5",
                                "sense_id": "c458bb46-9ce3-335d-89a1-26a52b1f5579",
                                "text": "Now Billy […] had some of the weaknesses inseparable from essential good-nature; and among these was a reluctance, almost an incapacity of plumply saying no to an abrupt proposition not obviously absurd, on the face of it, nor obviously unfriendly, nor iniquitous."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ea8b3c6-43a8-3b84-8bea-e35471e1de14",
                        "entry_id": "adffadb0-92be-36c9-90fd-9c8bf047cbbf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "With plumpness, in a plump way."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23129be2-d838-42b5-8754-a23d1ba30748",
                                "sense_id": "0ea8b3c6-43a8-3b84-8bea-e35471e1de14",
                                "text": "She lifted her night-dress over her head and for a moment caught a glimpse of her nakedness in the tarnished looking-glass—plumply rounded thighs and knees, the dimple in her stomach."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
